            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "nightfall"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is really flavorful and fun. I made it with homemade paneer and fresh off the cob white sweet corn and it was very hard to stop myself from eating all of it before calling the family to dinner. Oh, we are a cilantro-free household as most family members detest it, so I substituted pea shoots instead, and they were a nice addition to the dish. Give it a try!",
